  <prompt>Only if task 010 recorded "go": make project-pipeline Step 2 item 5 cite notes/reuse-scan.md when it exists and run the full design-to-spec scan only when it does not, with the 2+ candidate gate; and make task-create Step 3.5.6 cite the reuse-scan.md row when the file exists.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer maintaining AI procedure files.</role>
  <goal>project-pipeline and task-create both reference notes/reuse-scan.md with one fallback path and no partial re-scan.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-05; design.md sections 4.0 and 4.3. The built-in fallback replaces any absence lint.</background>
