  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Precondition: task 010's note says go; otherwise this task is cancelled.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">project-pipeline Step 2 Part 1 item 5 (~line 143): file exists means cite it; file missing means run the scan exactly as design-to-spec Step 3 defines it (reference, do not copy the procedure). 2+ candidates: interactive asks; autonomous STOPs at this gate with the options. No delta or partial re-scan.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">task-create Step 3.5.6: one added sentence that &lt;existing&gt; cites the reuse-scan.md row for the capability when the file exists. Do not renumber.</constraint>
